&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience supporting analytical or strategic workstreams and developing recommendations for senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years experience analyzing complex financial or operational data and translating findings into actionable business recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years experience navigating and organizing large data sets such as hospital price transparency reimbursement, claim files and provider rosters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting negotiations, commercial agreements, strategic partnerships, or other complex, cross-functional initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
