&lt;p&gt;The Manager, Actuarial leads a team of analysts and is responsible for pricing of several ACA markets. You will be a critical partner to Market P&amp;amp;L, Insurance Product, and other analytic support functions for consultation of regional specific pricing, network and product strategy. You will own the end-to-end regulatory submission, will understand risks underlying their markets, and are responsible to ensure pricing is actuarially sound.&lt;/p&gt;
