&lt;li&gt;Influence and collaborate with key stakeholders to guide strategic business decisions with respect to rates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and understand emerging A:E and market dynamics in your region and apply those learnings to guide the prospective pricing strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide an actuarial viewpoint across cross-functional teams to ensure sustainable growth for Oscar&#39;s ACA-compliant Individual Markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor, coach, and provide pricing analysts with regular feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote and shape Oscar actuarial best practices with respect to automation and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain strong relationships, rapport, and lines of communication with both internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
