&lt;li&gt;College degree in a STEM field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Associate or Fellow of the Society of Actuaries (SOA), or on the track to become one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of quantitative analysis experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
