&lt;li&gt;Provide feedback to support improvement in operational workflows and product features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compliance with all applicable laws and regulations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MD/DO from accredited program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Board Certification (ER/FM/IM)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of outpatient urgent care or emergency department experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience delivering virtual care/telemedicine&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read, write and speak in both Spanish and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidates must be onboarded with active licenses in both Tennessee and Florida via the Interstate Medical Licensure Compact (IMLC).&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
