&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with data leaders and business teams to enhance overall data processes, and lead execution with your team. Understand their needs and requirements, provide data support, and work together to develop solutions that improve processes and outcomes. Partner with business and technical stakeholders to prioritize opportunities, define success metrics, and guide experiments through evaluation and implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
