&lt;li&gt;4+ years experience building data models and using more advanced analytics methods, including conducting in depth analysis, rather than simple descriptive analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of&amp;nbsp; experience with statistical modeling and data processing/ETL pipeline building&lt;/li&gt;
