&lt;li&gt;Define the partnership strategy for Lucie Marketplace, including the role external partners should play in expanding consumer value, engagement, and monetization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a prioritized partner ecosystem across lifestyle, condition management, wellness, navigation, consumer health, and adjacent categories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify where partnerships can accelerate Lucie&#39;s marketplace strategy faster or more effectively than internal build.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop the commercial strategy for Lucie partnerships, including monetization models, value-sharing structures, and partner economics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Lucie leadership, Product, Marketing, Finance, Legal/Compliance, Data, and Operations to turn partnership strategy into scalable marketplace capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish the operating model for partner evaluation, launch readiness, relationship management, performance measurement, and value capture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own senior-level partner relationships and represent Lucie&#39;s marketplace vision externally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the foundation for a partnerships function that can scale over time as Lucie&#39;s marketplace matures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of experience in partnerships, business development, corporate strategy, product strategy, commercial strategy, or a related leadership function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience developing and executing partnership strategies, partner programs, or ecosystem initiatives that supported business growth or strategic objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience structuring, negotiating, or managing strategic commercial partnerships, including business models, revenue models, or enterprise partnership agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience building and managing executive-level relationships with external partners, customers, vendors, or strategic stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience leading cross-functional initiatives in partnership with Product, Marketing, Finance, Legal, Compliance, Data, and Operations teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience building or scaling new business functions, operating models, governance frameworks, or strategic programs within a high-growth or evolving organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience leading and developing high-performing teams, including managing senior individual contributors and/or people leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in consumer marketplaces, digital platforms, healthcare, insurance, or technology organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience evaluating partnership performance using financial, operational, customer engagement, or revenue metrics to inform strategic decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
