&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal and external partners to design scalable, compliant processes that meet evolving stakeholder and regulatory requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive workforce management and capacity planning to handle demand volatility and growth while safeguarding operational and financial targets.&lt;/li&gt;
