&lt;li&gt;Oversee short- and long-term operating budgets, balancing strategic growth investments with fiscal discipline and efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure strict adherence to financial controls, regulatory mandates, operational timeliness, and compliance standards.&lt;/li&gt;
