&lt;p&gt;The Senior Analyst, Actuarial supports Oscar’s Valuation processes for a number of Affordable Care Act (ACA) markets. You will be responsible for establishing Incurred but not Reported (IBNR) projections and risk adjustment accruals, and investigating actual performance trends that will inform budget planning, pricing, and company strategies. This position is eligible for the department’s rotational program.&lt;/p&gt;
