&lt;p&gt;Hi, we&#39;re Oscar. We&#39;re hiring a Staff User Experience Researcher to join our Insights &amp;amp; Analytics team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oscar is the first health insurance company built around a full stack technology platform and a relentless focus on serving our members. We started Oscar in 2012 to create the kind of health insurance company we would want for ourselves - one that behaves like a doctor in the family.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff User Experience Researcher, you will set research direction for complex, ambiguous initiatives across Oscar&#39;s products, services, and healthcare ecosystem. You will connect human insight with product, business, clinical, and operational evidence to shape strategy, clarify investments, and reduce risk. As a senior individual contributor, you will influence leaders and cross-functional teams, mentor others, and scale access to rigorous, reusable insights across the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report into the Vice President, Insights &amp;amp; Analytics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is based in our New York City office, requiring a hybrid work schedule with 3 days of in-office work per week. Thursdays are a required in-office day for team meetings and events, while your other two office days are flexible to suit your schedule. #LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base pay for this role is: $180,504.00 - $236,911.50 per year. You are also eligible for employee benefits, participation in Oscar&#39;s unlimited vacation program, company equity grants, and annual performance bonuses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set research direction and learning agendas for complex, cross-functional initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify where research can reduce uncertainty, uncover unmet needs, clarify investments, and inform product, business, clinical, and operational strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead qualitative, quantitative, and mixed-method research from problem framing through recommendation and application.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate research with analytics, market evidence, and operational knowledge to develop clear, evidence-based points of view.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence leaders and cross-functional partners to shape priorities, operating plans, roadmaps, investments, and launches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create reusable frameworks and insight systems that extend the value of research across teams and products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale responsible access to research through self-service guidance, shared knowledge systems, and AI-enabled tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advance research quality and practice through mentorship, standards, methods, and operational improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Model ethical, inclusive, rigorous, and compliant research practices in a regulated healthcare environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compliance with all applicable laws and regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties as assigned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of hands-on user research, product research, design research, or applied research.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience setting research direction for complex, ambiguous initiatives spanning multiple teams, products, or business functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using research to influence product, service, business, clinical, or operational strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in qualitative research and working knowledge of quantitative methods, with strong judgment about the evidence needed for a decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating research with analytics, market evidence, operational knowledge, or other complementary data sources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to translate evidence into clear recommendations that shape priorities, investments, operating plans, or launches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to influence senior leaders, align cross-functional stakeholders, and lead without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating reusable frameworks, standards, systems, or programs that increase research quality and organizational impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring researchers and strengthening research practice beyond an immediate product area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating ethical, privacy, compliance, or operational constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in healthcare, health insurance, benefits, financial services, or another regulated industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience researching multi-sided ecosystems involving consumers, members, brokers, providers, internal operators, or B2B2C products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to portfolio strategy, operating plans, or other senior-level planning processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing research-democratization programs, insight repositories, or AI-enabled knowledge systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering with Data Science, Analytics, Market Research, Operations, or Strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master&#39;s degree or Ph.D. in Human-Computer Interaction, Cognitive Psychology, Information Science, Anthropology, Sociology, Science and Technology Studies, or a related field, or equivalent professional experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spanish-language proficiency and experience researching with linguistically diverse populations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 5%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This is an authentic Oscar Health job opportunity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
